# One proxy share link per line.
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Supported schemes:
#   vless://  vmess://  ss://  trojan://  hysteria2://  hy2://
#
# TUIC is not supported by Xray-core and will be skipped with an error.
#
# Keep this file mode 0640 and never commit real credentials.

# vless://11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111@example.com:443?type=ws&security=tls&host=cdn.example.com&path=%2Fws&sni=cdn.example.com#example-vless
# vmess://BASE64_PAYLOAD
# ss://YWVzLTI1Ni1nY206c2VjcmV0@example.com:8388#example-ss
# trojan://password@example.com:443?type=ws&security=tls&host=cdn.example.com&path=%2Ft#example-trojan
# hysteria2://password@example.com:443?sni=example.com&obfs=salamander&obfs-password=secret#example-hy2
